{"type":"message","id":"b437ffaa","parentId":"9076e52b","timestamp":"2026-02-27T04:46:06.525Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，有 design-agent。让我启动它来进行技术评估。","thinkingSignature":"b38067eb6d04c52632cad6a7635b82e3ff0da9b6e50e8ddae8797f36d7f7628a"},{"type":"text","text":"现在开始 **阶段 1：设计**。我将委托 design-agent 进行技术评估：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_874gfekn1z8b_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat > /tmp/design-task.md << 'EOF'\n# FSRS 技术方案评估任务\n\n## 背景\nfsrs-memory 项目是一个基于 Node.js 的间隔重复学习系统。目前使用 `fsrs.js` 库实现 FSRS 算法。\n\n## 任务\n1. 评估 `ts-fsrs` (TypeScript) vs `fsrs.js` (当前使用) 的技术差异\n2. 检查 `ts-fsrs` 的 API 和功能\n3. 给出技术选型建议\n\n## 项目位置\n- 后端: `/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/`\n- FSRS 引擎: `/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/src/fsrs.js`\n\n## 输出要求\n请输出：\n1. 技术选型说明（是否需要从 fsrs.js 迁移到 ts-fsrs）\n2. 如果迁移，说明 API 差异和需要修改的代码\n3. 架构建议\n\n## 当前实现分析（供参考）\n- 当前使用: `const { FSRS, Card, Rating, State } = require('fsrs.js');`\n- 主要功能：Card/Review 状态管理、多牌组支持、主题切换\nEOF\ncat /tmp/design-task.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":15159,"output":312,"cacheRead":7949,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23420,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772167555019}}
